<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Đăng nhập | SHOPVN</title>

<link rel="icon" href="assets/images/logo/favicon.ico">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/auth.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/responsive.css">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ee4d2d,#ff6d3f,#ff9f43);
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
overflow:hidden;
position:relative;
}

body::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
width:650px;
height:650px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
border-radius:50%;
top:-220px;
left:-180px;
}

body::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
width:500px;
height:500px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
border-radius:50%;
bottom:-180px;
right:-150px;
}

.container{
width:1100px;
max-width:95%;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;
background:#fff;
border-radius:22px;
overflow:hidden;
box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
position:relative;
z-index:2;
}

.left{
background:linear-gradient(rgba(238,77,45,.90),rgba(255,109,63,.90)),url("assets/images/background/auth.jpg") center/cover;
color:#fff;
padding:70px 60px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
}

.logo{
font-size:44px;
font-weight:900;
letter-spacing:2px;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.left h1{
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.left p{
font-size:18px;
line-height:1.8;
opacity:.95;
}

.feature{
margin-top:40px;
display:grid;
gap:18px;
}

.feature div{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:15px;
font-size:17px;
font-weight:500;
}

.right{
padding:60px 55px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
}

.right h2{
font-size:34px;
color:#333;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.sub{
color:#777;
margin-bottom:35px;
}

.form-group{
margin-bottom:22px;
}

label{
display:block;
margin-bottom:8px;
font-weight:700;
color:#444;
}

input{
width:100%;
padding:15px 16px;
border:1px solid #ddd;
border-radius:10px;
font-size:15px;
outline:none;
transition:.3s;
}

input:focus{
border-color:#ee4d2d;
box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(238,77,45,.12);
}

.option{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
margin-bottom:25px;
font-size:14px;
}

.option a{
text-decoration:none;
color:#ee4d2d;
font-weight:600;
}

.login-btn{
width:100%;
padding:16px;
background:#ee4d2d;
color:#fff;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-size:17px;
font-weight:700;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.3s;
}

.login-btn:hover{
background:#d84324;
transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.divider{
text-align:center;
margin:28px 0;
position:relative;
color:#999;
}

.divider::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:50%;
width:42%;
height:1px;
background:#ddd;
}

.divider::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
right:0;
top:50%;
width:42%;
height:1px;
background:#ddd;
}

.social{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
gap:15px;
}

.social button{
padding:14px;
border:1px solid #ddd;
background:#fff;
border-radius:10px;
cursor:pointer;
font-weight:700;
transition:.3s;
}

.social button:hover{
background:#fafafa;
border-color:#ee4d2d;
}

.register{
text-align:center;
margin-top:28px;
color:#666;
}

.register a{
color:#ee4d2d;
font-weight:700;
text-decoration:none;
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.container{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.left{
display:none;
}

.right{
padding:45px 28px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="left">

<div class="logo">
SHOPVN
</div>

<h1>
Chào mừng trở lại!
</h1>

<p>
Đăng nhập để mua sắm hàng triệu sản phẩm chính hãng,
ưu đãi mỗi ngày và giao hàng nhanh trên toàn quốc.
</p>

<div class="feature">

<div>🛒 Hàng triệu sản phẩm</div>

<div>🚚 Giao hàng siêu tốc</div>

<div>💳 Thanh toán an toàn</div>

<div>🎁 Voucher mỗi ngày</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="right">

<h2>Đăng nhập</h2>

<div class="sub">
Tiếp tục mua sắm cùng SHOPVN
</div>

<form>

<div class="form-group">

<label>Email</label>

<input type="email" placeholder="example@gmail.com">

</div>

<div class="form-group">

<label>Mật khẩu</label>

<input type="password" placeholder="Nhập mật khẩu">

</div>

<div class="option">

<label>
<input type="checkbox">
 Ghi nhớ đăng nhập
</label>

<a href="#">
Quên mật khẩu?
</a>

</div>

<button class="login-btn" type="submit">
Đăng nhập
</button>

</form>

<div class="divider">
Hoặc
</div>

<div class="social">

<button>
🔵 Facebook
</button>

<button>
🟥 Google
</button>

</div>

<div class="register">

Chưa có tài khoản?

<a href="register.html">
Đăng ký ngay
</a>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<script src="assets/js/auth.js"></script>

</body>

</html>
<script src="assets/js/auth.js"></script>